sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Workload owner
    participant W as Grove or scheduler
    participant G as Group controller
    participant A0 as Node agent rank 0
    participant A1 as Node agent rank 1

    O->>W: Request the complete target Pod group
    W-->>O: Create and schedule all target Pods
    O->>G: Create PodGroupRestore with Pod names and UIDs
    G->>G: Validate targets and build the complete identity map
    par Existing rank 0 restore
        G->>A0: Activate restore with complete group context
        A0-->>G: Restored True or terminal failure
    and Existing rank 1 restore
        G->>A1: Activate restore with complete group context
        A1-->>G: Restored True or terminal failure
    end
    alt Every member reports Restored True
        G-->>O: PodGroupRestore Ready
        O->>O: Observe Pod readiness before serving
    else Any member reports terminal failure
        G-->>O: PodGroupRestore Failed with all member outcomes
        Note over O,G: The workload owner chooses recovery
    end
